add(8,['B matched P2 in half-open window','Effective start03:20','Delivered03:45 after25 minutes timely'], 'Is B effective acknowledgement start MB27 end03:20, producing timely25-minute response?', 'R03 R07 M02 M03 M04 T04 F03', ['Matching P2 detection inside [02:50,03:20) uses window end as effective start; allowance30 minutes inclusive.'], ['T04/M03 identify B as P2 and operation M-B matching MB27. Its03:10 detection is inside170≤190<200 minutes from origin.','M02 therefore selects03:20 (200), without changing historical detection. M04 says earlier operator contact was not the required acknowledgement.','Delivered03:45 (225) is25 minutes after effective start, before03:50 deadline.'],'bAcknowledgement','Audit.startB = 200 ∧ Audit.acknowledgementB - Audit.startB = 25 ∧ Audit.timely Audit.startB Audit.acknowledgementB 30')
